# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, keep host artefacts out
# of the image: node_modules built on Windows will not run on Alpine.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.vscode
.idea

# Secrets never belong in an image layer; the runtime gets env from compose.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

docs
agents
e2e/playwright-report
e2e/test-results

**/*.log